  "description": "Convert PDF to PDF/A in C# using this Docotic.Pdf add-on. Create PDF/A-compliant documents in .NET.\n\nUse the add-on to produce PDF/A documents in the C# code of your .NET Core, ASP.NET, Windows Forms, WPF, Xamarin, or Blazor application. The add-on supports .NET 10 - .NET 5, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET Framework 4.6.1+. You can use the add-on on Windows, Linux, and macOS. It works in Azure and AWS cloud environments and can be used from a Docker container.\n\nFind an overview of the PDF to PDF/A capabilities of this C# library at https://bitmiracle.com/pdf-library/conformance/pdf-to-pdfa\n\nCore library NuGet package: https://www.nuget.org/packages/BitMiracle.Docotic.Pdf/\n\nThis is a prerelease version with the newest features and latest bug fixes. We have tested it for regressions, and is safe to use in a production environment.",
